# Sensitive working data — never version-control raw captures, exports, registers,
# logs, or generated output. A private/personal Git repository is not an approved
# backup by default. Review company context, links, roadmaps, templates, and
# learning notes before committing; they may contain sensitive information.
inbox/**
archive/**
state/**
logs/**
registers/**
repos/**
outputs/**
!outputs/.gitkeep
browser-profiles/
.env
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
__pycache__/
# reference/links.csv and roadmap/*.csv are trackable; review for company data before committing.
